  3. RELEVAN: Menyesuaikan topologi produksi reverse proxy, Docker, dan Ubuntu server.
  
  Alokasi ID Rule:
  - 108100 - 108199 : Web Access & Reverse Proxy Anomaly Tuning
  - 108200 - 108299 : Host Runtime, AppArmor & Container Hardening Tuning
  - 108300 - 108399 : Vulnerability Detector & Patch Management Tuning
  - 108400 - 108449 : Authentication, SSH & Identity Governance Tuning
  - 108450 - 108479 : File Integrity Monitoring (FIM) & Package Lifecycle Tuning
  - 108480 - 108499 : System Health, Telemetry & Compliance Posture Tuning
  - 108500 - 108699 : True Positive Detection & Severity Escalation (MITRE ATT&CK)
  - 107100 - 107199 : Multi-Stage Attack Chains & Correlation Rules
  ================================================================================
-->

<group name="empirical_tuning,">

  <!-- ============================================================================
